    docs: document solver key fallback and PI_MODEL override
    
    Correct docs/integration.md solver key guidance to match
    cmd/off-by-one/main.go: DEEPSEEK_API_KEY is preferred for solves and
    OPENROUTER_API_KEY is the solver fallback when the former is absent or
    a placeholder (keeping the separate experimental/unwired DS-003
    embeddings note). Document PI_MODEL as an optional provider-qualified
    model override: a non-blank value is forwarded verbatim, while blank
    or whitespace-only is treated as unset.
    
    Docs-only change; no behavior modified.
    
    Addresses DOC-6
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
